   "titulo": {
    "@es": "En clase",
    "@en": "In class"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Open** y **close** son instrucciones: **Open your notebook** (abre el cuaderno) y **Close your notebook** (cierra el cuaderno).",
     "@en": "**Open** and **close** are instructions: **Open your notebook** (open the notebook) and **Close your notebook** (close the notebook)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**Read** es leer, **write** es escribir y **listen** es escuchar. Para pedir que repitan: **Listen and repeat**.",
     "@en": "**Read** is reading, **write** is writing and **listen** is listening. To ask them to repeat: **Listen and repeat**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**I have a question** significa «tengo una pregunta»; **the answer** es «la respuesta».",
     "@en": "**I have a question** means «I have a question.»; **the answer** is «the response»."
    }
   ]
  },
